# s55 — UTF-8 sigils and a char pin: kanji sym values (山賊 勇者 賊軍) written and matched
# through :Sym, a kanji ^alias (照準), and a kanji char column pinned directly with
# `--! expect 印 = …`. Every one of these was an ASCII-only surface before native nouns.
n 6
col 派閥 sym 山賊 勇者 山賊 勇者 山賊 勇者
col 印 char .#..#.
col 打撃 num 0 0 0 0 0 0
alias 照準 1 0 0 0 0 1
